@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping

### 3. Registrar estudiante
# @name registerStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estudiante Arquitectura",
  "email": "estudiante.arquitectura@example.com",
  "password": "pass@123"
}

### 4. Login estudiante
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "estudiante.arquitectura@example.com",
  "password": "pass@123"
}

### 5. Listar libros (regresión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}

### 6. Listar portátiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/laptops
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}

### 7. Crear portátil (requiere convertir este usuario en admin en MySQL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/laptops
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Lenovo",
  "model": "ThinkPad E14",
  "serial_number": "UTB-LAP-001"
}

### 8. Solicitar portátil
# @name borrowLaptop
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/laptop-loans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "laptop_id": 1
}

### 9. Mis préstamos de portátiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/laptop-loans/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}

### 10. Intentar préstamo duplicado (debe responder 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/laptop-loans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "laptop_id": 1
}

### 11. Devolver portátil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/laptop-loans/{{borrowLaptop.response.body.id}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}

### 12. Devolución repetida (debe responder 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/laptop-loans/{{borrowLaptop.response.body.id}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
